<br><br>
Surface Coal Mine
<br><br>
Fatal Powered Haulage Accident<br>
October 1, 2004
<br><br>
Jeddo Coal Company<br>
Jeddo No. 8 Preparation Plant<br>
Hazle Township, Luzerne County, PA<br>
ID No. 36-08649
<br><br>
Accident Investigators
<br><br>
Thomas J. Yencho<br>
Supervisory Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector

<br><br>
George J. McIntyre<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>

Kathleen A.  Radzavicz<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
James L. Angel<br>
Mechanical Engineer
<br><br>
Originating Office<br>
Mine Safety and Health Administration<br>
